{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1c066529d0a8f94ccb9ad6329fb89f1dc217cc9cb9e848ac9c8428411c5e062", "ja": "（今日は、グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\n杏奈の様子はどうだろう……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真照杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》。\n杏奈的状况不知道如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "f96d4ff19506aef52d14a0a473e561a5e9a46027155ac901ec9e942aa354eb1d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……制服、どう……？\n杏奈、いつもと違うけど……変じゃ、ない……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……制服看起来如何……？\n杏奈和平常不一样……会不会很奇怪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a4b8f532b7f2581f0e6a131c01fd44c9635dedd5e69af9eca8d1a4cbaf3bfe4f", "ja": "いや、よく似合ってるよ。\nその制服、杏奈にぴったりだと思う。", "zh": "不会，很适合你喔。\n我觉得那套制服非常适合杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "d549ae02b18a3d69fd7aa2d15a1c62ca95ef6d88ccf9993388eba26922499f96", "ja": "えへへ……よかった……。\nありがと……です♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……太好了……\n谢谢你……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1004_p", "source_sha256": "496a064677c59be3430c1057ad181b3f9fa43f66bb675c90917cc2c120eb2b35", "ja": "けど、杏奈が現役の中学生だからなのかな。\nなんだか自分が、担任の先生にでもなった気がするよ。", "zh": "但可能因为你现在正好就是国中生吧，\n感觉上我好像是你的班导呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "24b91228543f8f8740038ef7b96a5c75f8c55efba459ec9c0679a9c15ea81328", "ja": "うん……。杏奈も思った……。\n{$P$}さん、スーツ着てるし……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈也有这种感觉……\n而且{$P$}先生又穿西装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "d664e9b48b5b5fbc9b93456154539adbd6c699bb28ed20435d014c7040a2ac1a", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、杏奈の先生だったら\n……杏奈に、勉強……教えてほしい、です。", "zh": "如果{$P$}先生是杏奈的老师……\n希望你可以……教杏奈读书。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "702d40b9c8a9938c8859e34867b3870599b496e68b46151bc73672ba552bb1f4", "ja": "杏奈、勉強得意じゃないけど……\nアイドルみたいに、好きになれる、かも……。", "zh": "虽然杏奈不太会读书……\n但说不定会像喜欢偶像一样，喜欢上读书……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e47aba59e53e4d01d8b88a80b022708ba87829364f311a4bdae49e43d469204f", "ja": "そうか……\n杏奈は学校の勉強、あんまり好きじゃないのか？", "zh": "这样啊……\n你不太喜欢在学校上课吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "5893ebd5c17fb923c791ec7f7bf7cffc62ac2550a6a90299b20ea2827bd2a29a", "ja": "うん……難しくて、よくわからない……。\n授業、早く終わらないかなって……。", "zh": "嗯……好难，杏奈都看不懂……\n一直希望赶快下课……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "17d4365da22b51dfdcc041c1c3be60a8eea4923e444ffc565e6905440ad7d21b", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんが先生だったら……\n勉強も、学校も……楽しくなりそう……♪", "zh": "但如果老师是{$P$}先生的话……\n感觉读书和上学……都会很开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5ff5fea37ba76d24007221283724ac30e16e63d80492489de35370e20ac22802", "ja": "そうか？\nそう言ってもらえると、なんだか嬉しいな。", "zh": "是吗？\n听你这么说，总觉得很高兴呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "ceb4c0eacd3a17bdd6e55cf0b0d3e99f2f3e4af33d4f72e0be8167e863497137", "ja": "杏奈、勉強、得意じゃないから……\n教えてもらうの、時間かかっちゃうけど……。", "zh": "因为杏奈不擅长读书……\n要教杏奈的话应该很花时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "9cd855c8f24176e97efdd95766d904f56262887ba74aa6ff5162a4519f6962a1", "ja": "杏奈が、覚えるまで……\nちゃんと……教えて、くれますか……？", "zh": "你愿意一直教杏奈……\n教到杏奈……会为止吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8ee0792cff820f637c4ba6cb00ec9b1c8e452f26a9635df331bfee6c5b1dc14d", "ja": "もちろん。杏奈がしっかり理解できるまで、\n毎日勉強会するぞ！", "zh": "当然，我会每天开读书会，\n直到你完全理解的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "416c7b9854316d78eaba481f62b89a7d3f7d41193040b820f99db6d8e277840e", "ja": "ホント……？　じゃあ、撮影が終わったら……\n宿題のわからないところ、教えてくれますか……？", "zh": "真的……？那拍摄结束之后……\n杏奈不会写的功课，可以请你来教吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "19377705f762a545cb4378f231c8831091bc0191c029905dd1a7c4fb2432bb03", "ja": "杏奈が、ちゃんとわかるようになるまで……\nつきあってください……♪", "zh": "请教到……\n杏奈全都学会为止……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1017_p", "source_sha256": "17942cec8c5f4615d2cc301873edbfe61e152b766e71b181959dabf078a9e308", "ja": "そうだな……よし！　今日は\n先生になって、何時間でも付き合うぞ！", "zh": "这样啊……好！\n今天我就来当老师，要教几小时都没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0103_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "bc99990c238ed6a82aa4c38e01b42de6fe799b484d00041816c7910b0d51c5b4", "ja": "えへへ……ありがと、です。\n先生も、ファイト……だよ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你。\n老师也要……加油喔……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
